This project is a port of Greg's SG Craft by Greg Ewing to Minecraft 1.20.1.

The original SG Craft is released under the following licence, quoted
verbatim from the mod's web page
(http://www.cosc.canterbury.ac.nz/greg.ewing/minecraft/mods/SGCraft/,
"Licence" section, retrieved 2026-11-12):

    This is free software. You are free to do whatever you want with it.

The same terms apply to this port.
